@startuml state_machine_diagram
'=======================================================================
' STATE MACHINE DIAGRAM
' Lifecycle of a Physical Edge Device
' Privacy-Preserving and Resource-Aware Federated Learning System
' Standard: OMG UML 2.5.1
' Notation: PlantUML
'=======================================================================

!theme cerulean-outline
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #EDE7F6
    BorderColor #4527A0
    ArrowColor #1565C0
    StartColor #1B5E20
    EndColor #B71C1C
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #F57F17
}

title State Machine Diagram: Edge Device Lifecycle

[*] --> Unregistered : Device powered on

Unregistered --> Registered : registration accepted
Unregistered --> Failed : registration rejected

Registered --> Authenticated : credentials verified
Registered --> Offline : heartbeat timeout

Authenticated --> Available : telemetry started

Available --> TrainingLocally : selected for round\n[resources eligible]
Available --> Offline : connection lost

state TrainingLocally {
    TrainingLocally : do / run local SGD on private dataset D_k
    TrainingLocally : do / apply DP (clip + noise)
    TrainingLocally : do / sparsify, quantize, apply SecAgg mask
    TrainingLocally : exit / upload masked update y_k
}

note right of TrainingLocally
    Local dataset D_k
    NEVER leaves this device.
end note

TrainingLocally --> WaitingForNextRound : update uploaded
TrainingLocally --> Offline : network failure or deadline exceeded
TrainingLocally --> Failed : training error

WaitingForNextRound --> Available : round completed
WaitingForNextRound --> TrainingLocally : immediately re-selected

Offline --> Authenticated : reconnected (token valid)
Offline --> Registered : token expired
Offline --> [*] : device shutdown

Failed --> Unregistered : recovery complete
Failed --> [*] : permanent failure

@enduml
